printf 'NOTE: closure lexer carries 2 PINNED known edges (quote-awareness). The\n' >&2
printf '      component is end-of-life; its replacement is a queued design\n' >&2
printf '      decision (shfmt-AST / python walker / amend the no-deps line).\n' >&2
