# ── request-integrity Bug A: worker resume symmetry (recover from meta like main) ────
# On resume, workers must be recovered from the session's OWN meta (names PRESERVED),
# NOT re-derived from config workspace.workers — a config workers= rename applies to
# NEW sessions ONLY. Identity v2 moved the resolution into the CORE: `_resolve_workers`
