# The shared sensor + region primitive are emitted into the send-path _lib (runtime).
# _input_region_prompt_seg is load-bearing: unemitted, every codex send would call an
# undefined function, read indeterminate, and silently stop verifying submits.
# Membership in the parsed list, not one literal run of names: the list wraps
# across continuation lines and rewraps whenever a name joins or leaves it, so a
