# rows -> false IDLE -> the pre-paste guard clobbers the draft, colead ROUND4 BLOCKER).
# The bottom is bounded by the box's CHROME instead (_input_region_content_end), which
# is a property of the rendered box rather than of where the caret happens to be.
# Source-text matching cannot prove geometry — that is colead's finding that the old
# geometry test was inert — so both real seams live in tests/integration
# ("input-region: prompt >8 rows above cursor", "cursor-not-end: ...").
