_ar48_c_newrep="$(_ar48_cancel_fixture \
    '{"ts":"1","actor":"a:one","action":"ask","ref":"c-newrep","target":"b:two","summary":"q"}' \
    '{"ts":"2","actor":"a:one","action":"cancel","ref":"c-newrep","summary":"withdrawn"}' \
    '{"ts":"3","actor":"b:two","action":"reply","ref":"c-newrep","target":"a:one","summary":"answered anyway"}')"
# TERMINAL, not merely newest: a valid withdrawal closes the request for good, so a reply
